{"text": "12 × (9 / 3) - 10 = 12 × 3 - 10 = 36 - 10 = 26", "start": 552, "end": 598, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Let's solve it step-by-step with another method:", "start": 600, "end": 648, "label": "suggest"}
{"text": "(12 - 9) + (10 × 3) = 3 + 30 = 33", "start": 650, "end": 683, "label": "inform"}
